# Z-UI token source policy

- Canonical token implementations are root `colors.css`, `sizes.css`, `text.css`, `motion.css`, and `elevation.css`.
- Their design contracts are `COLOR-SEMANTICS.md`, `SIZES-SEMANTICS.md`, `TEXT-SEMANTICS.md`, `MOTION-SEMANTICS.md`, and `ELEVATION-SEMANTICS.md`.
- Never edit `packages/tokens/dist/**` or other `dist/**` files directly.
- Change the relevant semantics documentation and canonical root CSS when intentionally changing the token system.
- Run `pnpm --filter @z-ui/tokens build` to regenerate published token CSS.
- Components consume semantic tokens; primitives are reserved for defining the token system.
- **12px (`font.size.1` / `0.75rem`) is the minimum font size.** Do not add primitives, semantic roles, or component styles below this floor.
- Ask before introducing a new semantic token, component-scoped token, or documented exception.
